Subject: [PATCH 048/240] DIAG: keep the ED_DIAG reply in its word buffer.

The ED_DIAG reply has 71 words, but editor.c had w[70].
The last check in ble_diag reserved 2 words, but 4 words follow it.
Thus ble_diag wrote one word past the end of w[] on the stack.
editor.c now has w[71], and the last check in ble_diag reserves 4 words.
The reply of 71 words fills ed_out (362 bytes) and does not go past it.
tests/diag_size_test.py counts the words and the bytes, and checks each free-space check in ble_diag.
web/EDITOR_PROTOCOL.md gives the new maximum of 71 words.
