build/host/.results/*.time gives the time of each test.
The tests that integration added are in class S: smk-clip-ble-clear, smk-clip-ble-notify (BLE code),
installer-ctl (install path) and rec-live (it reads build/gen from host-build). perf-scratch is in class C,
