The gate builds Elite, Pro, FM-1 and the Bluetooth image, runs tests/run_tests.sh (8 jobs, time scale 1),
checks the flash map (with the owner tag at 0xAF000), the sizes of the three builds, the X0X_RAM_CANARY default,
the reference pins and the list of tests that ran, and writes one result file for each tree.
