From c96f4eff30267b2c28417da00c676c8e5d6a9080 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: genkigenki <3080081+genkigenki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:02:17 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 089/240] MID-15: take Song Position only from the input with
 the clock.

seq_clk_take now also filters Song Position (F2).
While an input has the clock, X0X ignores a Song Position from another input.
A Song Position gets no clock and does not keep the clock.
With no input that has the clock, and in INTERNAL, a Song Position passes from all inputs.
The reason: a Song Position of the other input moved the clip-mode blink position.
tests/host/clk_lock_test.c checks these cases in AUTO, EXTERNAL and INTERNAL.
Elite size: app code 0 B (the image size did not change), static RAM 0 B, pool 0 B.
