The old calculation with SMK_CLIP_LCD_FLOOR goes away from the firmware.
SMK_CLIP_LCD_FLOOR stays, because tools/apc_pad_colors.py reads it.
The pads, the empty cell dot, mode entry, the menu and the disconnect paths do not change.
tests/smk_apc40_test.py checks the new lookup and these paths.
tests/apc40_lcd565_test.c checks the lookup for velocity 0, 127 and values above 127.
BEHAVIOR.md CLP-05 and APC40_IMPLEMENTATION.md give the new rule, and CLP-05 has the correct code references.
Reason: the owner approved this table (docs/USER_PREFERENCES.md line 64).
The build uses 176 B more app code, 0 B more static RAM and 0 B more pool.
