Subject: [PATCH 138/240] Gate: build and test the dev and rel configs
 (X0X_DEV_PADCAL=1 and 0).

- The gate removes X0X_DEV_* and the other build variables of the caller.
- Each config has its own worktree, HOME and TMPDIR. The builds and the tests of the two configs run at the same time.
- The result is PASS only if the two configs pass. The pool limit (8192 B) applies to each build.
- The CRC manifest has the dev lines (build/) and the rel lines (rel/build/).
- The result file has the line "- Config CRCs:". The index row has it in a new last column (Configs).
- The gate uses a result again only if it has the two configs.
- New test: test_gate_configs.sh.
