and table rows that have a line added or changed in BASE..REV. The
quick check uses this mode. It checks the commit messages in full, as
before. An installed ste_check.py with no --diff mode stops a strict
check.

test_quickcheck_ste.sh: a new clean row passes, a new bad row fails,
and a change in an old paragraph checks that paragraph.
