Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:01:38 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 152/240] Test: the PLAY and REC LEDs follow the owner link
 (CLP-18).

Owner order 2026-10-17 02:00: the PLAY and REC LED feedback follow
the same rule as the clip cells. The link that wrote the LED last
owns it. Only the end of that link turns it off.

New cases in tests/host/smk_clip_usb_clear_test.sh:
P1: USB owns PLAY. The USB cable goes out: PLAY goes off.
P2: Bluetooth owns REC. A USB cable-out or a bus reset: REC stays on.
P3: USB owns PLAY, Bluetooth owns REC. CCCD 0 or the end of the
Bluetooth link: PLAY stays on, REC goes off.

P4: generic mode on USB turns off the LEDs that USB owns.
P5: a Bluetooth REC off while notify is off turns REC off.

On 30a08fc cases P1, P2 (bus reset), P3 (two cases) and P4 (USB owns)
fail. The fix comes in the next commit. This test is in
tests/run_tests.sh, so tests/run_tests.sh fails at this commit only.
