From 2dfda65108c24086c31539b61bf71fe235c4f988 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: genkigenki <3080081+genkigenki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:53:10 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 162/240] Test: the clip mode knobs send their CC on USB and
 Bluetooth.

The owner reports that the knobs do nothing in clip mode on c6bf44a.
This host test turns knobs 2 and 5 in clip mode. It checks CC 48 and
CC 51 on USB and on Bluetooth after each Loopy event. The events are
the handshake, modes 0x40 and 0x42, the clip colours and a Bluetooth
end, a USB suspend and a new enumeration.

The test passes on f9bcc46 and on each commit up to c6bf44a. Thus the
cause is not in these commits. Case K8 shows that the test sees knobs
that send nothing (a menu on the screen).
