Subject: [PATCH 164/240] Clip screen: show "WAITING FOR LOOPY PRO" until a
 link has a Loopy host (CLP-80).

The clip mode LCD shows the waiting screen, not the 8x5 grid, while no link has a Loopy host. A link (USB or Bluetooth) has a host after the first clip or PLAY / REC LED message on that link. The end of that link, generic mode or a USB host loss clears it, as for the clip cells (CLP-18). Then the waiting screen comes back.

The handshake alone does not set the host, because smk_apc_host_seen does not get the link. No change to usb.c or ble.c.

