+# reference: "same" = the package head, "flip:OFF" = the package head with one byte changed at OFF (hex),
+#   "short" = 0x3FFF bytes, "app:OFF" = same head, then a changed byte at OFF >= 0x4000 (outside the head).
+# want: OK (exit 0), MISMATCH (exit 11, REFUSED), ERROR (exit 11, REFUSED, no compare).
+same head|same|OK
