 <p>When you turn a knob, its value shows in large type for a second, with whose it is: a track's (BD TUNE) or a pattern's (P3 LENGTH). Settings that belong to the pattern change when the pattern does, and are copied with it; the sound stays the same whatever pattern plays.</p>
 <p>The <strong>footer</strong> at the very bottom says what the keys do on this screen (BLACK: TRACK, WHITE: STEP). Until you first press a button it says HOLD ANY BUTTON: WHAT IT DOES.</p>
