-<p><strong>Copy and paste.</strong> Hold SAVE: the top line says P1 COPIED. Press a white key to paste onto that pattern (P1 PASTED TO P2): all five parts, as they're playing now. If the pattern you paste onto has notes, X0X asks first. While holding SAVE, OCT- and OCT+ switch between patterns 1–16 and 17–32.</p>
